- Material Design Icons (@mdi/js), Pictogrammers. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign — each entry's `src` is the @mdi/js export it came from.
- Material Symbols (@material-symbols/svg-400, outlined), Google. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/marella/material-symbols — each entry's `src` is the icon file name it came from.

Licence text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 (also in node_modules/@mdi/js/LICENSE and node_modules/@material-symbols/svg-400/LICENSE after `pnpm install`).
